(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="b465d733-eb2e-49a2-9625-8d164674aa02" data-testid="conversation-turn-2" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="a3dc9dd3-320f-48d7-87eb-2acfa2153d9d" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="118">Got it — I can help you step-by-step with your <strong data-start="47" data-end="115">Data Science Internship at <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Prodigy Infotech</span></span></strong> 👍</p>
<p data-start="120" data-end="195">First, let me quickly understand where you are so I can guide you properly:</p>
<p data-start="197" data-end="209"><strong data-start="197" data-end="209">Tell me:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="210" data-end="390">
<li data-section-id="15p3lde" data-start="210" data-end="288">
<p data-start="213" data-end="288">Which <strong data-start="219" data-end="235">task/project</strong> are you working on right now? (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14x9a6p" data-start="289" data-end="345">
<p data-start="292" data-end="345">Did they give you a <strong data-start="312" data-end="344">dataset or problem statement</strong>?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b4eq9k" data-start="346" data-end="390">
<p data-start="349" data-end="390">Are you using <strong data-start="363" data-end="389">Python (Jupyter/Colab)</strong>?</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="392" data-end="395">
<h2 data-section-id="bw03f7" data-start="397" data-end="435">Meanwhile, here’s how I’ll help you</h2>
<p data-start="437" data-end="460">I can support you with:</p>
<ul data-start="461" data-end="741">
<li data-section-id="t29uym" data-start="461" data-end="504">
<p data-start="463" data-end="504">✅ Understanding the <strong data-start="483" data-end="504">problem statement</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1t736tl" data-start="505" data-end="538">
<p data-start="507" data-end="538">✅ Writing <strong data-start="517" data-end="538">clean Python code</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hi2dqy" data-start="539" data-end="601">
<p data-start="541" data-end="601">✅ Explaining concepts (like EDA, ML, etc.) <em data-start="584" data-end="601">in simple terms</em></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18xwha5" data-start="602" data-end="628">
<p data-start="604" data-end="628">✅ Fixing <strong data-start="613" data-end="628">errors/bugs</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="n90094" data-start="629" data-end="683">
<p data-start="631" data-end="683">✅ Helping you complete and <strong data-start="658" data-end="683">submit tasks properly</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9yy2ar" data-start="684" data-end="741">
<p data-start="686" data-end="741">✅ Creating <strong data-start="697" data-end="741">reports / GitHub README / LinkedIn posts</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="743" data-end="746">
<h2 data-section-id="ca4613" data-start="748" data-end="804">Typical Tasks at Prodigy (so you know what to expect)</h2>
<p data-start="806" data-end="834">Most interns get tasks like:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="asw5ri" data-start="836" data-end="869">🔹 Task 1: Data Visualization</h3>
<ul data-start="870" data-end="945">
<li data-section-id="1vlenlx" data-start="870" data-end="945">
<p data-start="872" data-end="901">Bar charts, histograms using:</p>
<ul data-start="904" data-end="945">
<li data-section-id="lrobvl" data-start="904" data-end="914">
<p data-start="906" data-end="914"><code data-start="906" data-end="914">pandas</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gmsmuo" data-start="917" data-end="931">
<p data-start="919" data-end="931"><code data-start="919" data-end="931">matplotlib</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1w01rzi" data-start="934" data-end="945">
<p data-start="936" data-end="945"><code data-start="936" data-end="945">seaborn</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="64vc8p" data-start="947" data-end="981">🔹 Task 2: Data Cleaning + EDA</h3>
<ul data-start="982" data-end="1034">
<li data-section-id="5zvjuj" data-start="982" data-end="1007">
<p data-start="984" data-end="1007">Handling missing values</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="so2ov5" data-start="1008" data-end="1034">
<p data-start="1010" data-end="1034">Finding patterns in data</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="13jifp3" data-start="1036" data-end="1067">🔹 Task 3: Machine Learning</h3>
<ul data-start="1068" data-end="1122">
<li data-section-id="c4zv7n" data-start="1068" data-end="1104">
<p data-start="1070" data-end="1104">Linear Regression / Classification</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jv22pu" data-start="1105" data-end="1122">
<p data-start="1107" data-end="1122">Using <code data-start="1113" data-end="1122">sklearn</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="16zgm5u" data-start="1124" data-end="1157">🔹 Task 4+: Advanced Projects</h3>
<ul data-start="1158" data-end="1227">
<li data-section-id="a87d15" data-start="1158" data-end="1201">
<p data-start="1160" data-end="1201">Real datasets (sales, social media, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="173rm4m" data-start="1202" data-end="1227">
<p data-start="1204" data-end="1227">Predictions or insights</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1229" data-end="1232">
<h2 data-section-id="1t7lul4" data-start="1234" data-end="1266">Example (simple starter code)</h2>
<p data-start="1268" data-end="1294">If you're doing basic EDA:</p>
