<p data-start="1553" data-end="1575">Your <strong data-start="1558" data-end="1575">task question</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="plrkqc" data-start="1576" data-end="1591">
<p data-start="1578" data-end="1591">Your <strong data-start="1583" data-end="1591">code</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1azz20w" data-start="1592" data-end="1618">
<p data-start="1594" data-end="1618">Or even a <strong data-start="1604" data-end="1618">screenshot</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1620" data-end="1715">…and I’ll:<br>
👉 Explain EVERYTHING like a beginner<br data-start="1668" data-end="1671">
👉 Fix your code<br data-start="1687" data-end="1690">
👉 Help you finish fast</p>
<hr data-start="1717" data-end="1720">
