ong>, and I’ll help you complete <strong data-start="147" data-end="180">Task-02 (Data Cleaning + EDA)</strong> step-by-step <em data-start="194" data-end="228">with explanation like a beginner</em>.</p>
<hr data-start="231" data-end="234">
<h1 data-section-id="8nfva3" data-start="236" data-end="269">✅ 1. Understanding Your Dataset</h1>
<p data-start="271" data-end="288">Your dataset has:</p>
<ul data-start="289" data-end="513">
<li data-section-id="1fccux8" data-start="289" data-end="299">
<p data-start="291" data-end="299">418 rows</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="d4cs6d" data-start="300" data-end="513">
<p data-start="302" data-end="320">Important columns:</p>
<ul data-start="323" data-end="513">
<li data-section-id="16yi21f" data-start="323" data-end="369">
<p data-start="325" data-end="369"><code data-start="325" data-end="333">Pclass</code> → Ticket class (1 = rich, 3 = poor)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="94ykuw" data-start="372" data-end="393">
<p data-start="374" data-end="393"><code data-start="374" data-end="379">Sex</code> → Male/Female</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1en4kfe" data-start="396" data-end="423">
<p data-start="398" data-end="423"><code data-start="398" data-end="403">Age</code> → Missing values ⚠️</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="eiiq4j" data-start="426" data-end="449">
<p data-start="428" data-end="449"><code data-start="428" data-end="434">Fare</code> → Ticket price</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8offza" data-start="452" data-end="481">
<p data-start="454" data-end="481"><code data-start="454" data-end="461">Cabin</code> → Mostly missing ⚠️</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="jtr2q8" data-start="484" data-end="513">
<p data-start="486" data-end="513"><code data-start="486" data-end="496">Embarked</code> → Port (S, C, Q)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="515" data-end="518">
<h1 data-section-id="1clnofp" data-start="520" data-end="557">✅ 2. Data Cleaning (VERY IMPORTANT)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="1cplr1y" data-start="559" data-end="581">🔹 Problems found:</h3>
<ul data-start="582" data-end="680">
<li data-section-id="ohgb45" data-start="582" data-end="606">
<p data-start="584" data-end="606"><code data-start="584" data-end="589">Age</code> → Missing values</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gn2lx0" data-start="607" data-end="633">
<p data-start="609" data-end="633"><code data-start="609" data-end="615">Fare</code> → 1 missing value</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a4005m" data-start="634" data-end="680">
<p data-start="636" data-end="680"><code data-start="636" data-end="643">Cabin</code> → Too many missing values (can drop)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="682" data-end="685">
<h2 data-section-id="10en7i4" data-start="687" data-end="734">✅ Cleaned Code (WRITE THIS IN YOUR NOTEBOOK)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="736" data-end="1127"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-00d8790d.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-00d8790d.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost border-token-border-default ms-2 border font-sans" aria-label="Run code" type="button"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-label="" class="-ms-0.5 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-00d8790d.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Run</div></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼg">import</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">pandas</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">as</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">pd</span><br><br><span class="ͼm">df</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">pd</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>read_csv(</span><span class="ͼk">"test.csv"</span><span>)</span><br><br><span class="ͼe"># Check missing values</span><br><span class="ͼm">print</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼm">df</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>isnull()</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>sum())</span><br><br><span class="ͼe"># Fill Age with median</span><br><span class="ͼm">df</span><span>[</span><span class="ͼk">'Age'</span><span>]</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>fillna(</span><span class="ͼm">df</span><span>[</span><span class="ͼk">'Age'</span><span>]</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>median(), </span><span class="ͼm">inplace</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">True</span><span>)</span><br><br><span class="ͼe"># Fill Fare with median</span><br><span class="ͼm">df</span><span>[</span><span class="ͼk">'Fare'</span><span>]</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>fillna(</span><span class="ͼm">df</span><span>[</span><span class="ͼk">'Fare'</span><span>]</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>median(), </span><span class="ͼm">inplace</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">True</span><span>)</span><br><br><span class="ͼe"># Drop Cabin (too many missing values)</span><br><span class="ͼm">df</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>drop(</span><span class="ͼk">'Cabin'</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">axis</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">inplace</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">True</span><span>)</span><br><br><span class="ͼm">print</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼk">"After Cleaning:</span><span class="ͼq">\n</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">df</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>isnull()</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>sum())</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1129" data-end="1132">
<h1 data-section-id="jlcxxs" data-start="1134" data-end="1172">✅ 3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)</h1>
<p data-start="1174" data-end="1214">Now we <strong data-start="1181" data-end="1214">find patterns &amp; relationships</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1216" data-end="1219">
<h2 data-section-id="1rgkbkr" data-start="1221" data-end="1249">🔹 1. Gender Distribution</h2>
