<p data-start="2358" data-end="2369">👉 Insight:</p>
<ul data-start="2370" data-end="2397">
<li data-section-id="12rtudx" data-start="2370" data-end="2397">
<p data-start="2372" data-end="2397">More males in all classes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2399" data-end="2402">
<h1 data-section-id="fskyf0" data-start="2404" data-end="2446">✅ 4. Key Findings (WRITE IN YOUR REPORT)</h1>
<p data-start="2448" data-end="2467">You can write this:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="6euyvu" data-start="2469" data-end="2489">📊 Observations:</h3>
<ul data-start="2490" data-end="2688">
<li data-section-id="r0u7d" data-start="2490" data-end="2531">
<p data-start="2492" data-end="2531">Most passengers belong to <strong data-start="2518" data-end="2531">3rd class</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qcyby3" data-start="2532" data-end="2565">
<p data-start="2534" data-end="2565"><strong data-start="2534" data-end="2552">Males are more</strong> than females</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1oo5gpm" data-start="2566" data-end="2610">
<p data-start="2568" data-end="2610">Most passengers are aged between <strong data-start="2601" data-end="2610">20–40</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1f3cr8t" data-start="2611" data-end="2659">
<p data-start="2613" data-end="2659"><strong data-start="2613" data-end="2638">Fare is highly skewed</strong> (few paid very high)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="kbj6w4" data-start="2660" data-end="2688">
<p data-start="2662" data-end="2688">Higher class → higher fare</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2690" data-end="2693">
<h1 data-section-id="1y18p0x" data-start="2695" data-end="2733">✅ 5. Important Note (VERY IMPORTANT)</h1>
<p data-start="2735" data-end="2794">⚠️ Your dataset is a <strong data-start="2756" data-end="2772">test dataset</strong>, so it does NOT have:</p>
<ul data-start="2795" data-end="2814">
<li data-section-id="3repqa" data-start="2795" data-end="2814">
<p data-start="2797" data-end="2814"><code data-start="2797" data-end="2807">Survived</code> column</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2816" data-end="2830">👉 That means:</p>
<ul data-start="2831" data-end="2903">
<li data-section-id="1bf3hd0" data-start="2831" data-end="2869">
<p data-start="2833" data-end="2869">You <strong data-start="2837" data-end="2869">cannot analyze survival rate</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xjpd6w" data-start="2870" data-end="2903">
<p data-start="2872" data-end="2903">Only patterns (EDA) are allowed</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2905" data-end="2908">
