dir="auto" translate="no"><p><span>🚀 Excited to share my progress in my Data Science Internship at Prodigy Infotech!</span></p><p><span>📊 </span><strong><span>Task-02 Completed: Data Cleaning &amp; Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)</span></strong></p><p><span>In this task, I worked on the Titanic dataset to understand how real-world data is analyzed and interpreted.</span></p><p><span>🔍 </span><strong><span>What I did:</span></strong></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p><span>Cleaned the dataset by handling missing values</span></p></li><li><p><span>Performed Exploratory Data Analysis using Python</span></p></li><li><p><span>Created visualizations using Matplotlib &amp; Seaborn</span></p></li><li><p><span>Identified patterns and relationships between variables</span></p></li></ul><p><span>📈 </span><strong><span>Key Insights:</span></strong></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p><span>Majority of passengers belonged to 3rd class</span></p></li><li><p><span>Male passengers were more than female passengers</span></p></li><li><p><span>Most passengers were aged between 20–40</span></p></li><li><p><span>Fare distribution showed strong variation across classes</span></p></li></ul><p><span>💡 This task helped me strengthen my understanding of:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p><span>Data preprocessing</span></p></li><li><p><span>Data visualization</span></p></li><li><p><span>Extracting meaningful insights from raw data</span></p></li></ul><p><span>Grateful for the opportunity to learn and grow through this internship 🙌</span></p><p><span>Looking forward to working on more exciting projects ahead!</span></p><p><span>#DataScience #Internship #ProdigyInfotech #EDA #Python #MachineLearning #LearningJourney</span></p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-2 rounded-[24px] shadow-[inset_0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.07)]"></div></div></div>
