<h1 data-section-id="15bl32g" data-start="149" data-end="184">✅ What you need to do for Task-03</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="nrve2y" data-start="186" data-end="198">🎯 Goal:</h3>
<p data-start="199" data-end="288">Build a <strong data-start="207" data-end="235">Decision Tree Classifier</strong> to predict:<br>
👉 Will a customer <strong data-start="267" data-end="288">purchase (yes/no)</strong></p>
<hr data-start="290" data-end="293">
<h1 data-section-id="1chgobe" data-start="295" data-end="319">✅ 1. About the Dataset</h1>
<p data-start="321" data-end="398">Use the <strong data-start="329" data-end="398">Bank Marketing Dataset from <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">UCI Machine Learning Repository</span></span></strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1j58y4f" data-start="400" data-end="421">🔹 Target Column:</h3>
<ul data-start="422" data-end="471">
<li data-section-id="1er5fib" data-start="422" data-end="471">
<p data-start="424" data-end="471"><code data-start="424" data-end="427">y</code> → <strong data-start="430" data-end="442">yes / no</strong> (customer subscribed or not)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="11hbc2n" data-start="473" data-end="489">🔹 Features:</h3>
<ul data-start="490" data-end="574">
<li data-section-id="1q09inq" data-start="490" data-end="516">
<p data-start="492" data-end="516">Age, job, marital status</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ucfs3y" data-start="517" data-end="532">
<p data-start="519" data-end="532">balance, loan</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="kjga40" data-start="533" data-end="547">
<p data-start="535" data-end="547">contact type</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="5c5npw" data-start="548" data-end="574">
<p data-start="550" data-end="574">campaign, duration, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="576" data-end="579">
<h1 data-section-id="1ple4jw" data-start="581" data-end="632">✅ 2. What YOU should do about dataset (IMPORTANT)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="136kmik" data-start="634" data-end="664">✔️ Option 1 (BEST &amp; EASY):</h3>
<p data-start="665" data-end="709">Download:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="678" data-end="695">bank-full.csv</strong> (or bank.csv)</p>
