<h1 data-section-id="149x6hw" data-start="46" data-end="73">✅ 📥 Download the Dataset</h1>
<p data-start="75" data-end="120">Get the <strong data-start="83" data-end="109">Bank Marketing dataset</strong> from here:</p>
<p data-start="122" data-end="254">👉 <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">UCI Machine Learning Repository</span></span><br data-start="162" data-end="165">
Download link:<br data-start="179" data-end="182">
<a data-start="182" data-end="254" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer">https://archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/machine-learning-databases/00222/bank.zip<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-00d8790d.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<hr data-start="256" data-end="259">
<h1 data-section-id="f1k7g6" data-start="261" data-end="296">✅ 📂 What to do after downloading</h1>
<ol data-start="298" data-end="412">
<li data-section-id="y6cyt9" data-start="298" data-end="319">
<p data-start="301" data-end="319"><strong data-start="301" data-end="319">Unzip the file</strong></p>
</li>
