<p data-start="323" data-end="334">You’ll see:</p>
<ul data-start="338" data-end="412">
<li data-section-id="1slzhev" data-start="338" data-end="363">
<p data-start="340" data-end="363"><code data-start="340" data-end="350">bank.csv</code> ✅ (use this)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3srlc5" data-start="367" data-end="412">
<p data-start="369" data-end="412"><code data-start="369" data-end="384">bank-full.csv</code> (bigger version — optional)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="414" data-end="417">
<h1 data-section-id="ow1x52" data-start="419" data-end="452">✅ 📤 Upload to your environment</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="1qo2fun" data-start="454" data-end="484"><span role="text">If using <strong data-start="467" data-end="483">Google Colab</strong>:</span></h3>
<ul data-start="485" data-end="543">
<li data-section-id="1bm5poj" data-start="485" data-end="523">
<p data-start="487" data-end="523">Click <strong data-start="493" data-end="523">Files (left side) → Upload</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1bzqun9" data-start="524" data-end="543">
<p data-start="526" data-end="543">Upload <code data-start="533" data-end="543">bank.csv</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="ly3g9l" data-start="545" data-end="579"><span role="text">If using <strong data-start="558" data-end="578">Jupyter Notebook</strong>:</span></h3>
<ul data-start="580" data-end="637">
<li data-section-id="rrhojm" data-start="580" data-end="637">
<p data-start="582" data-end="637">Put <code data-start="586" data-end="596">bank.csv</code> in the same folder as your <code data-start="624" data-end="632">.ipynb</code> file</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="639" data-end="642">
