<hr data-start="74" data-end="77">
<h1 data-section-id="t1799q" data-start="79" data-end="134">✅ 🖥️ If you're using Windows (your case most likely)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="ve454g" data-start="136" data-end="168">🔹 Step 1: Download the file</h3>
<ul data-start="169" data-end="235">
<li data-section-id="19rq8go" data-start="169" data-end="235">
<p data-start="171" data-end="235">After clicking the link, you’ll get a file like:<br>
👉 <code data-start="225" data-end="235">bank.zip</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="237" data-end="240">
<h3 data-section-id="tlmjqy" data-start="242" data-end="279">🔹 Step 2: Go to Downloads folder</h3>
<ul data-start="280" data-end="326">
<li data-section-id="3cfur5" data-start="280" data-end="304">
<p data-start="282" data-end="304">Open <strong data-start="287" data-end="304">File Explorer</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1b0b0td" data-start="305" data-end="326">
<p data-start="307" data-end="326">Click <strong data-start="313" data-end="326">Downloads</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="328" data-end="331">
<h3 data-section-id="1qkawa5" data-start="333" data-end="363">🔹 Step 3: Extract (UNZIP)</h3>
<p data-start="365" data-end="448">👉 Right-click on <code data-start="383" data-end="393">bank.zip</code><br data-start="393" data-end="396">
👉 Click <strong data-start="405" data-end="423">“Extract All…”</strong><br data-start="423" data-end="426">
👉 Click <strong data-start="435" data-end="448">“Extract”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="450" data-end="453">
<h3 data-section-id="xfrsrt" data-start="455" data-end="495">🔹 Step 4: Open the extracted folder</h3>
<p data-start="497" data-end="512">Now you’ll see:</p>
<ul data-start="513" data-end="556">
<li data-section-id="1t7x31j" data-start="513" data-end="538">
<p data-start="515" data-end="538"><code data-start="515" data-end="525">bank.csv</code> ✅ (use THIS)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="saun94" data-start="539" data-end="556">
<p data-start="541" data-end="556"><code data-start="541" data-end="556">bank-full.csv</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="558" data-end="561">
<h1 data-section-id="xluaht" data-start="563" data-end="585">✅ 📂 What to do next</h1>
<p data-start="587" data-end="625">👉 Copy <code data-start="595" data-end="605">bank.csv</code><br data-start="605" data-end="608">
👉 Paste it into:</p>
<ul data-start="626" data-end="701">
<li data-section-id="1t7cwus" data-start="626" data-end="669">
<p data-start="628" data-end="669">Your <strong data-start="633" data-end="660">Jupyter Notebook folder</strong><br data-start="660" data-end="663">
<strong data-start="663" data-end="669">OR</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="laz8av" data-start="670" data-end="701">
<p data-start="672" data-end="701">Upload it to <strong data-start="685" data-end="701">Google Colab</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="703" data-end="706">
<h1 data-section-id="1j5d8xw" data-start="708" data-end="733">⚡ If using Google Colab</h1>
<ol data-start="735" data-end="831">
<li data-section-id="1ff5exy" data-start="735" data-end="758">
<p data-start="738" data-end="758">Open your notebook</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1el1imn" data-start="759" data-end="788">
<p data-start="762" data-end="788">Left sidebar → <strong data-start="777" data-end="786">Files</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4simyd" data-start="789" data-end="810">
<p data-start="792" data-end="810">Click <strong data-start="798" data-end="808">Upload</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wvp9eh" data-start="811" data-end="831">
<p data-start="814" data-end="831">Select <code data-start="821" data-end="831">bank.csv</code></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="833" data-end="836">
<h1 data-section-id="wroei3" data-start="838" data-end="872">❗ If you don’t see “Extract All”</h1>
<p data-start="874" data-end="954">Do this:<br>
👉 Right-click → <strong data-start="900" data-end="929">Open with → File Explorer</strong><br data-start="929" data-end="932">
👉 Then drag files out</p>
