<h3 data-section-id="ktbcr5" data-start="470" data-end="489">🧠 Explanation:</h3>
<ul data-start="490" data-end="735">
<li data-section-id="11ze0u6" data-start="490" data-end="526">
<p data-start="492" data-end="526"><code data-start="492" data-end="500">pandas</code> → to handle data (tables)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ye7kpf" data-start="527" data-end="554">
<p data-start="529" data-end="554"><code data-start="529" data-end="536">numpy</code> → math operations</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1an49g1" data-start="555" data-end="613">
