<h3 data-section-id="ktbcr5" data-start="1348" data-end="1367">🧠 Explanation:</h3>
<ul data-start="1368" data-end="1527">
<li data-section-id="1qr2k61" data-start="1368" data-end="1413">
<p data-start="1370" data-end="1413">Machine learning <strong data-start="1387" data-end="1413">cannot understand text</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7v41qd" data-start="1414" data-end="1483">
<p data-start="1416" data-end="1430">So we convert:</p>
<ul data-start="1433" data-end="1483">
<li data-section-id="o3nu5g" data-start="1433" data-end="1444">
<p data-start="1435" data-end="1444">"yes" → 1</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12m05yj" data-start="1447" data-end="1457">
<p data-start="1449" data-end="1457">"no" → 0</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ta93ke" data-start="1460" data-end="1483">
<p data-start="1462" data-end="1483">"admin" → 2 (example)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12zqomf" data-start="1484" data-end="1527">
<p data-start="1486" data-end="1527">Loop applies encoding to all text columns</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1529" data-end="1532">
<h1 data-section-id="5vs1yb" data-start="1534" data-end="1569">🚀 STEP 5: Split Data (IMPORTANT)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="177lg7u" data-start="1571" data-end="1582">📌 Code</h3>
