" class="-ms-0.5 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-00d8790d.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Run</div></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼm">X</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">df</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>drop(</span><span class="ͼk">'y'</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">axis</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span>)  </span><span class="ͼe"># features</span><br><span class="ͼm">y</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">df</span><span>[</span><span class="ͼk">'y'</span><span>]               </span><span class="ͼe"># target</span><br><br><span class="ͼm">X_train</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">X_test</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">y_train</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">y_test</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">train_test_split</span><span>(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">X</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">y</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">test_size</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">0.2</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">random_state</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">42</span><br><span>)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="ktbcr5" data-start="1768" data-end="1787">🧠 Explanation:</h3>
<ul data-start="1788" data-end="1951">
<li data-section-id="cg0ht6" data-start="1788" data-end="1833">
<p data-start="1790" data-end="1833"><code data-start="1790" data-end="1793">X</code> → input data (everything except target)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="owzlo8" data-start="1834" data-end="1866">
<p data-start="1836" data-end="1866"><code data-start="1836" data-end="1839">y</code> → output (what we predict)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1a1q0jb" data-start="1867" data-end="1906">
<p data-start="1869" data-end="1906"><code data-start="1869" data-end="1884">test_size=0.2</code> → 80% train, 20% test</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15qbfih" data-start="1907" data-end="1951">
<p data-start="1909" data-end="1951"><code data-start="1909" data-end="1926">random_state=42</code> → same result every time</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1953" data-end="1956">
