<h1 data-section-id="hqmc6a" data-start="3046" data-end="3087">🎯 FINAL UNDERSTANDING (VERY IMPORTANT)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="1jykizp" data-start="3089" data-end="3121">💡 What your model is doing:</h3>
