<hr data-start="1913" data-end="1916">
<h1 data-section-id="a9wr21" data-start="1918" data-end="1951">🎯 Simple Real-Life Explanation</h1>
<p data-start="1953" data-end="1977">Think of this tree like:</p>
<p data-start="1979" data-end="2014">👉 A bank manager asking questions:</p>
<ol data-start="2016" data-end="2099">
<li data-section-id="rq45br" data-start="2016" data-end="2042">
<p data-start="2019" data-end="2042">Did the call last long?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bushtm" data-start="2043" data-end="2077">
<p data-start="2046" data-end="2077">Does the customer have balance?</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gkztma" data-start="2078" data-end="2099">
<p data-start="2081" data-end="2099">What is their job?</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="2101" data-end="2145">👉 Based on answers → decides:<br>
<strong data-start="2132" data-end="2145">YES or NO</strong></p>
